{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":50,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":9574,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1880407,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":281338,"Name":"sbodnar4","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1418658416,"LastPoster":{"Id":284153,"Name":"Ambie","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284153.jpeg?_r=1454355937","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":38,"Preview":{"Id":1880407,"PostDate":1418658416,"PostContent":"Hello Ladies!!! \u00a0 I am very new to this and am looking for help. I have never been to a destinati...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stephbodnar4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.161.231.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417960726,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"sbodnar4","Id":281338,"Name":"sbodnar4","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.161.230.10","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b10c9a28a7c1e5d28c7d3a908bd7db9b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello Ladies!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am very new to this and am looking for help. I have never been to a destination wedding but have had lots of advice from other friends who have.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My question is... is there any way of getting my hands on the extras that the RIU Palace in Cabo has before I speak with my wedding coordinator. We are just trying to make up a budget and I only can access the package pricing for their 3 packages that they offer.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If anyone could please help me out. Even if you are a bride that could forward me the email that would be great.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks a million ladies&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880407,"PostDate":1418658416,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello Ladies!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am very new to this and am looking for help. I have never been to a destination wedding but have had lots of advice from other friends who have.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My question is... is there any way of getting my hands on the extras that the RIU Palace in Cabo has before I speak with my wedding coordinator. We are just trying to make up a budget and I only can access the package pricing for their 3 packages that they offer.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If anyone could please help me out. Even if you are a bride that could forward me the email that would be great.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks a million ladies<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stephbodnar4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.161.231.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417960726,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"sbodnar4","Id":281338,"Name":"sbodnar4","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5de9a5ed01540fbfcd553256e8c27522","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"sbodnar4\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I responded to your earlier post.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m in the same situation and have been trying to obtain information and work out a budget.   So far here&#039;s some other information that I&#039;ve found and\/or obtained from other Riu brides...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s the link to the Riu Palace photographer:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.myweddinginloscabos.net\/blog\/packages-2015-2\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.myweddinginloscabos.net\/blog\/packages-2015-2\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The Riu Palace florist:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/bajaflower.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/bajaflower.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I contacted them through their website inquiring about pricing yesterday and still waiting for their response.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880414,"PostDate":1418669089,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281338\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281338-sbodnar4\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">sbodnar4<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>I responded to your earlier post.\u00a0 I'm in the same situation and have been trying to obtain information and work out a budget.\u00a0\u00a0 So far here's some other information that I've found and\/or obtained from other Riu brides...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here's the link to the Riu Palace photographer:<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/www.myweddinginloscabos.net\/blog\/packages-2015-2\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.mywedding...ackages-2015-2\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The Riu Palace florist:<\/p>\n<p><a href='http:\/\/bajaflower.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/bajaflower.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>I contacted them through their website inquiring about pricing yesterday and still waiting for their response.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jrcorrales@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413927246,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280778.jpg?_r=1421562169","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmorDeMiVida","Id":280778,"Name":"AmorDeMiVida","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.161.230.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"22957b30fdc6f5417f89aaa34806e5ba","RawContent":"&lt;a  class=\"\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280778-amordemivida\/\" title=\"\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;AmorDeMiVida&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;thanks so much for all your help. Our wedding is May 10, 2016.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880425,"PostDate":1418712055,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                \n\t<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280778-amordemivida\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span>AmorDeMiVida<\/span><\/a>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>thanks so much for all your help. Our wedding is May 10, 2016.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stephbodnar4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.161.231.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417960726,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"sbodnar4","Id":281338,"Name":"sbodnar4","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.15.193.73","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f799005fbef6ed63bd1a4374cb403cab","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m getting married at the Riu Santa Fe (price was better for our guests) in July. I have the Palace extras list for 2014 that they originally sent me when beginning to plan my wedding. It was sent to me as a PDF so I&#039;m not sure how to share it on here? If you want I can email it to you. Let me know if you have any other questions!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Jenna&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880464,"PostDate":1418735003,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm getting married at the Riu Santa Fe (price was better for our guests) in July. I have the Palace extras list for 2014 that they originally sent me when beginning to plan my wedding. It was sent to me as a PDF so I'm not sure how to share it on here? If you want I can email it to you. Let me know if you have any other questions!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Jenna<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenna32schap@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.97.32.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1394358300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277065.jpg?_r=1438546602","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jenna32schap","Id":277065,"Name":"jenna32schap","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.62.214.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1081c90830ed9a95e9abc8bc72a2fd35","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"jenna32schap\"] I am also considering the Riu for my wedding and would LOVE to see the extras list if you don&#039;t mind! My email is toriw83@[member=\"gmail\"].com.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;When is your wedding?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880500,"PostDate":1418742582,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277065\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/277065-jenna32schap\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jenna32schap<\/span><\/a> I am also considering the Riu for my wedding and would LOVE to see the extras list if you don't mind! My email is toriw83@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>When is your wedding?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"toriw83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.62.214.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413907662,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"toriw83","Id":280772,"Name":"toriw83","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.15.193.73","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4ba06b3f498699ec706075450f0fc49f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Sure! I will send you the Palace extras list. Again, it is for 2014 so I&#039;m sure prices will change. I also have all the info for the Santa Fe If you need anything! I&#039;m getting married on July 20, 2015.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Jenna&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880506,"PostDate":1418747995,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Sure! I will send you the Palace extras list. Again, it is for 2014 so I'm sure prices will change. I also have all the info for the Santa Fe If you need anything! I'm getting married on July 20, 2015.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Jenna<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenna32schap@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.97.32.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1394358300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277065.jpg?_r=1438546602","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jenna32schap","Id":277065,"Name":"jenna32schap","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"965ffbcddba3204224d9ebbb797a266c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"toriw83\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I also emailed you the Riu Palace&#039;s 2015 information which includes the pricing list for extras, banquet menu, etc.&amp;nbsp; Hope it helps with your research and decision making.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880539,"PostDate":1418754281,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280772\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/280772-toriw83\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">toriw83<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I also emailed you the Riu Palace's 2015 information which includes the pricing list for extras, banquet menu, etc.\u00a0 Hope it helps with your research and decision making.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jrcorrales@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413927246,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280778.jpg?_r=1421562169","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmorDeMiVida","Id":280778,"Name":"AmorDeMiVida","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.62.214.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2f15f00707b1ddfb9d80115effe2c7e3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks so much for the information - it is very helpful!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Are either of you using a Travel Agent?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880620,"PostDate":1418829905,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks so much for the information - it is very helpful!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Are either of you using a Travel Agent?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"toriw83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.62.214.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413907662,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"toriw83","Id":280772,"Name":"toriw83","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"684537a08f74d2117ce819f53a9bc54e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"toriw83\"] and @[member=\"sbodnar4\"] I emailed the both of you some additional information that I received from Ana Maria today.&amp;nbsp; @[member=\"toriw83\"] I am using Teresa Stauring from Vacations 4 Less (Los Angeles, CA) after hearing so many great things about her on this forum.&amp;nbsp; After speaking with her and emailing, I knew she was someone I definitely wanted to work with.&amp;nbsp; She has been very helpful, responsive and has answered all my questions via email and phone.&amp;nbsp; There was instance when I emailed her on a Saturday afternoon thinking I would get a response the following Monday.&amp;nbsp; She responded immediately and from that I can tell she is very dedicated to her clients. I&#039;m glad that there are other Riu Palace brides so we can help each other out.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;- Janice &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;   &lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880703,"PostDate":1418846048,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280772\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/280772-toriw83\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">toriw83<\/span><\/a> and @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281338\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281338-sbodnar4\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">sbodnar4<\/span><\/a> I emailed the both of you some additional information that I received from Ana Maria today.\u00a0 @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280772\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/280772-toriw83\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">toriw83<\/span><\/a> I am using Teresa Stauring from Vacations 4 Less (Los Angeles, CA) after hearing so many great things about her on this forum.\u00a0 After speaking with her and emailing, I knew she was someone I definitely wanted to work with.\u00a0 She has been very helpful, responsive and has answered all my questions via email and phone.\u00a0 There was instance when I emailed her on a Saturday afternoon thinking I would get a response the following Monday.\u00a0 She responded immediately and from that I can tell she is very dedicated to her clients. I'm glad that there are other Riu Palace brides so we can help each other out.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>- Janice \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jrcorrales@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413927246,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280778.jpg?_r=1421562169","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmorDeMiVida","Id":280778,"Name":"AmorDeMiVida","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.15.193.236","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"babb4d56cd1ade731332faf519d220d9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@toriw83&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are using Apple Vacations. I would definitely recommend using a Travel Agent. A lot of our guests have reached out to Apple with a wide variety of questions (both prior to booking and after). They provide a room discount if you book your flight through them. They also provide transportation to and from the airport (which I&#039;m sure most places do). I couldn&#039;t imagine having all of our guests book on their own and then having them asking us questions that we may not have answers to! I think having a Travel Agent takes away some of the stress! Also, there is an Apple representative at the resort for any on sight questions.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Jenna&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880775,"PostDate":1418910195,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@toriw83\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are using Apple Vacations. I would definitely recommend using a Travel Agent. A lot of our guests have reached out to Apple with a wide variety of questions (both prior to booking and after). They provide a room discount if you book your flight through them. They also provide transportation to and from the airport (which I'm sure most places do). I couldn't imagine having all of our guests book on their own and then having them asking us questions that we may not have answers to! I think having a Travel Agent takes away some of the stress! Also, there is an Apple representative at the resort for any on sight questions.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Jenna<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenna32schap@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.97.32.162","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1394358300,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277065.jpg?_r=1438546602","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jenna32schap","Id":277065,"Name":"jenna32schap","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"78482","Title":"Riu Package Extras","LastPostDate":1454013228},"Pages":{"TotalItems":50,"TotalPages":5,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":40},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
