{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"74.62.214.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aab6a4262786b05253da0699d1d92b54","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks to both of you that&#039;s really helpful! I&#039;ve spoken to a couple travel agents I didn&#039;t particularly like because they were clearly pushing me toward resorts they had partnerships with, rather than the resorts I liked. But I definitely need someone to handle the guest travel.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880779,"PostDate":1418913605,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks to both of you that's really helpful! I've spoken to a couple travel agents I didn't particularly like because they were clearly pushing me toward resorts they had partnerships with, rather than the resorts I liked. But I definitely need someone to handle the guest travel.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"toriw83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.62.214.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413907662,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"toriw83","Id":280772,"Name":"toriw83","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.161.231.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e796f85f212cc5e7217b7bc026a1238c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Big news ladies...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The resort finally contacted our travel agent and said our date was confirmed!!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am so excited!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;though a little worried cause I thought the prices would be a little more reasonable... wasnt aware that we would be paying for ALOT of extras!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Anyways we will make it work!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880833,"PostDate":1419003630,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Big news ladies...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The resort finally contacted our travel agent and said our date was confirmed!!!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am so excited!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>though a little worried cause I thought the prices would be a little more reasonable... wasnt aware that we would be paying for ALOT of extras!!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyways we will make it work!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stephbodnar4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.161.231.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417960726,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"sbodnar4","Id":281338,"Name":"sbodnar4","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.166.144.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"58337fc0aeaa17ea45b1951d84e40be9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"sbodnar4\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Yay!&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s a great feeling getting that confirmation from them.&amp;nbsp; I know how you feel about all the extras.&amp;nbsp; They must have given me an older extra list which stated that open bar is included with the private menu per person fee.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I guess now&amp;nbsp;its an additional $20 per person for the international open bar.&amp;nbsp; That just means&amp;nbsp;budgeting more wisely...&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Which TA are you using?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880834,"PostDate":1419005418,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281338\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281338-sbodnar4\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">sbodnar4<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Yay!\u00a0 It's a great feeling getting that confirmation from them.\u00a0 I know how you feel about all the extras.\u00a0 They must have given me an older extra list which stated that open bar is included with the private menu per person fee.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I guess now\u00a0its an additional $20 per person for the international open bar.\u00a0 That just means\u00a0budgeting more wisely...\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Which TA are you using?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jrcorrales@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413927246,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280778.jpg?_r=1421562169","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmorDeMiVida","Id":280778,"Name":"AmorDeMiVida","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.161.231.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"59e584ae0cd19ed1932b1f6f98d60b7f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Ya thats the frusterating thing is the bar... we are going to an all inclusive resort and have to pay for a bar... i dont really understand that...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are using a lady named Nicola from Maritime Travel in St. Albert, Alberta. She has been amazing and has got us such good quotes for our guests!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1880835,"PostDate":1419006110,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Ya thats the frusterating thing is the bar... we are going to an all inclusive resort and have to pay for a bar... i dont really understand that...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are using a lady named Nicola from Maritime Travel in St. Albert, Alberta. She has been amazing and has got us such good quotes for our guests!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stephbodnar4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.161.231.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417960726,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"sbodnar4","Id":281338,"Name":"sbodnar4","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"24c4abf320bda120f866fa288d121608","RawContent":"[quote name=\"sbodnar4\" post=\"1880835\" timestamp=\"1419034910\"]\nYa thats the frusterating thing is the bar... we are going to an all inclusive resort and have to pay for a bar... i dont really understand that...\n\nWe are using a lady named Nicola from Maritime Travel in St. Albert, Alberta. She has been amazing and has got us such good quotes for our guests![\/quote]Congrats fellow Albertan!\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1880849,"PostDate":1419029714,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>sbodnar4, on 19 December 2014 - 04:21 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Ya thats the frusterating thing is the bar... we are going to an all inclusive resort and have to pay for a bar... i dont really understand that...<br><br>\nWe are using a lady named Nicola from Maritime Travel in St. Albert, Alberta. She has been amazing and has got us such good quotes for our guests!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nCongrats fellow Albertan!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399399802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.182.103.222","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"abc8e3e853fab2b8ef19bbd77f5f0e65","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am also confused about the bar fee! I read some older posts that said there is a bar very close to the receptions area (if you choose Baja Norte area, which seems most popular). And that they had their guests go to that bar. They gave them a nice tip to make sure they gave attention to their guests quickly. Anyone else hear about this?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881025,"PostDate":1419319153,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am also confused about the bar fee! I read some older posts that said there is a bar very close to the receptions area (if you choose Baja Norte area, which seems most popular). And that they had their guests go to that bar. They gave them a nice tip to make sure they gave attention to their guests quickly. Anyone else hear about this?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"smchambers06@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.182.103.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419318808,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281467.jpeg?_r=1457907391","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"samFEB2016","Id":281467,"Name":"samFEB2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5e036facaaff895d095d054cb70c7f70","RawContent":"[quote name=\"samFEB2016\" post=\"1881025\" timestamp=\"1419347953\"]\nI am also confused about the bar fee! I read some older posts that said there is a bar very close to the receptions area (if you choose Baja Norte area, which seems most popular). And that they had their guests go to that bar. They gave them a nice tip to make sure they gave attention to their guests quickly. Anyone else hear about this?[\/quote]\nI have also read this on other threads which has convinced me to skip the open bar.\n\nSince our ceremony is at 4:00 PM there is some time until our reception at 7:00 PM.  While we take pictures, our guests will have time to freshen up before dinner, relax, drink at the lobby bar if they wish or take advantage of their liquor dispensers in their rooms.  I&#039;m not sure if getting the open bar is worth it because not everyone in our party will take advantage of it. \n\n@[member=\"samFEB2016\"]\nAre you considering the Riu Palace or have you set a date?","Attachments":[],"Id":1881360,"PostDate":1419974856,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>samFEB2016, on 23 December 2014 - 07:19 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I am also confused about the bar fee! I read some older posts that said there is a bar very close to the receptions area (if you choose Baja Norte area, which seems most popular). And that they had their guests go to that bar. They gave them a nice tip to make sure they gave attention to their guests quickly. Anyone else hear about this?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I have also read this on other threads which has convinced me to skip the open bar.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Since our ceremony is at 4:00 PM there is some time until our reception at 7:00 PM.\u00a0 While we take pictures, our guests will have time to freshen up before dinner, relax, drink at the lobby bar if they wish or take advantage of their liquor dispensers in their rooms.\u00a0 I'm not sure if getting the open bar is worth it because not everyone in our party will take advantage of it.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281467\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281467-samfeb2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">samFEB2016<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Are you considering the Riu Palace or have you set a date?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jrcorrales@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413927246,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280778.jpg?_r=1421562169","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmorDeMiVida","Id":280778,"Name":"AmorDeMiVida","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.14.188.159","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"72f0577678207c57f06d7cc2afa7e686","RawContent":"@[member=\"AmorDeMiVida\"] Good idea! Yes we set Feb 20th 2016 at the Riu Palace. So exciting!! What about you??","Attachments":[],"Id":1881584,"PostDate":1420232988,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280778\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280778-amordemivida\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">AmorDeMiVida<\/span><\/a> Good idea! Yes we set Feb 20th 2016 at the Riu Palace. So exciting!! What about you??\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"smchambers06@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.182.103.222","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1419318808,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281467.jpeg?_r=1457907391","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"samFEB2016","Id":281467,"Name":"samFEB2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.161.230.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0a948db81bed12dfe23dc4889e1eac7b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"samFEB2016\" post=\"1881584\" timestamp=\"1420261788\"]\n@[member=\"AmorDeMiVida\"] Good idea! Yes we set Feb 20th 2016 at the Riu Palace. So exciting!! What about you??[\/quote]\nThis is so exciting!!! Have you ever been to the resort? We havnt but i think we are going to take a mini vacation in the summer to go see. My fiances uncle has a condo in Cabo so it will make it an affordable trip :D","Attachments":[],"Id":1881623,"PostDate":1420272132,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>samFEB2016, on 02 January 2015 - 09:09 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280778\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280778-amordemivida\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">AmorDeMiVida<\/span><\/a> Good idea! Yes we set Feb 20th 2016 at the Riu Palace. So exciting!! What about you??<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is so exciting!!! Have you ever been to the resort? We havnt but i think we are going to take a mini vacation in the summer to go see. My fiances uncle has a condo in Cabo so it will make it an affordable trip <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\t\u00a0\n\n\t\u00a0\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stephbodnar4@gmail.com","IpAddress":"198.161.231.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1417960726,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"sbodnar4","Id":281338,"Name":"sbodnar4","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"97f9f65b2c9d38f7a0c4315beea48999","RawContent":"@[member=\"samFEB2016\"] and @[member=\"sbodnar4\"] I was a bridesmaid for a 2010 destination wedding at Riu Palace in Cabo  and you&#039;ve both chosen a great resort. The rooms were clean as were the pools. It was very relaxing and service was wonderful. My friend opted against having a bar and honestly, I didn&#039;t even notice. The bars are close by and we&#039;d just grab drinks after going to the washroom. I do remember some of the servers getting us drinks for us (tipping generously may have helped )","Attachments":[],"Id":1881659,"PostDate":1420294380,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281467\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281467-samfeb2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">samFEB2016<\/span><\/a> and @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281338\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281338-sbodnar4\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">sbodnar4<\/span><\/a> I was a bridesmaid for a 2010 destination wedding at Riu Palace in Cabo  and you've both chosen a great resort. The rooms were clean as were the pools. It was very relaxing and service was wonderful. My friend opted against having a bar and honestly, I didn't even notice. The bars are close by and we'd just grab drinks after going to the washroom. I do remember some of the servers getting us drinks for us (tipping generously may have helped )\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410069785,"Photo":{"Has