{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9c7934f86a57b7edf84ea19cdc2a74e8","RawContent":"[quote name=\"samFEB2016\" post=\"1881584\" timestamp=\"1420261788\"]\n@[member=\"AmorDeMiVida\"] Good idea! Yes we set Feb 20th 2016 at the Riu Palace. So exciting!! What about you??[\/quote]\n@[member=\"samFEB2016\"]\nOur date is set for June 16, 2016.\n[quote name=\"sbodnar4\" post=\"1881623\" timestamp=\"1420300932\"]\n\nThis is so exciting!!! Have you ever been to the resort? We havnt but i think we are going to take a mini vacation in the summer to go see. My fiances uncle has a condo in Cabo so it will make it an affordable trip :D\n   \n[\/quote]\n@[member=\"sbodnar4\"] Most likely we will not visit the resort.  That is so cool that you have somewhere to stay when you visit.  When you go you will have to share your photos and tell us about it :D.\n[quote name=\"Wafflesmom\" post=\"1881659\" timestamp=\"1420323180\"]\n@[member=\"samFEB2016\"] and @[member=\"sbodnar4\"] I was a bridesmaid for a 2010 destination wedding at Riu Palace in Cabo  and you&#039;ve both chosen a great resort. The rooms were clean as were the pools. It was very relaxing and service was wonderful. My friend opted against having a bar and honestly, I didn&#039;t even notice. The bars are close by and we&#039;d just grab drinks after going to the washroom. I do remember some of the servers getting us drinks for us (tipping generously may have helped )[\/quote]Thank you so much for the information which very helpful to us.  From all the online reviews everyone has also mentioned the cleanliness and the great service which is awesome.","Attachments":[],"Id":1881665,"PostDate":1420297440,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>samFEB2016, on 02 January 2015 - 09:09 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280778\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280778-amordemivida\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">AmorDeMiVida<\/span><\/a> Good idea! Yes we set Feb 20th 2016 at the Riu Palace. So exciting!! What about you??<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281467\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281467-samfeb2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">samFEB2016<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Our date is set for June 16, 2016.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>sbodnar4, on 03 January 2015 - 08:02 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is so exciting!!! Have you ever been to the resort? We havnt but i think we are going to take a mini vacation in the summer to go see. My fiances uncle has a condo in Cabo so it will make it an affordable trip <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\u00a0 \u00a0\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281338\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281338-sbodnar4\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">sbodnar4<\/span><\/a> Most likely we will not visit the resort.\u00a0 That is so cool that you have somewhere to stay when you visit.\u00a0 When you go you will have to share your photos and tell us about it <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/>.<\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Wafflesmom, on 03 January 2015 - 02:13 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281467\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281467-samfeb2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">samFEB2016<\/span><\/a> and @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281338\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281338-sbodnar4\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">sbodnar4<\/span><\/a> I was a bridesmaid for a 2010 destination wedding at Riu Palace in Cabo  and you've both chosen a great resort. The rooms were clean as were the pools. It was very relaxing and service was wonderful. My friend opted against having a bar and honestly, I didn't even notice. The bars are close by and we'd just grab drinks after going to the washroom. I do remember some of the servers getting us drinks for us (tipping generously may have helped )<\/p><\/div><\/div><br>\nThank you so much for the information which very helpful to us.  From all the online reviews everyone has also mentioned the cleanliness and the great service which is awesome.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jrcorrales@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.42.28.220","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413927246,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280778.jpg?_r=1421562169","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmorDeMiVida","Id":280778,"Name":"AmorDeMiVida","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"198.161.230.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78482,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ea1f6c328d114e0579465de9de1af7e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thank you so much for that advice! I just love this website everyone is so helpful.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I was worried people would be offended without the bar right there but realy if they utilize their bar in the room and other bars around the resort it should be good right???&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1881667,"PostDate":1420298058,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thank you so much for that advice! I just love this website everyone is so helpful.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was worried people would be offended without the bar right there but realy if they utilize their bar in the room and other bars around the resort it should be good right???<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Aut